# maxi-config-owned ShellCheck configuration.
#
# Distributed to every org repo as .shellcheckrc by scripts/sync-maxi-review.sh
# --manifest review-configs. Edit it HERE, not in the target repo.
#
# Lives at the repo ROOT because Codacy detects ShellCheck config by that name.
# Kept identical to .qlty/configs/.shellcheckrc so qlty, the Codacy CLI, the
# Codacy PR bot and a bare local `shellcheck` all behave the same way.

# Resolve `source`/`.` relative to the script being checked rather than the
# invoking directory. Without this, every script sourcing a sibling helper
# reports SC1091 (not following: file not found).
source-path=SCRIPTDIR
